SUMMARY:Special Call Meeting - FY27 Budget Workshop  1
LOCATION:Tampa \, FL United States
DESCRIPTION:NOTICE OF PUBLIC MEETING TAMPA CITY COUNCIL SPECIAL CALL MEETI
 NG FY27 BUDGET WORKSHOP  1 Date: Monday\, August 3\, 2026 Time: 9:00 AM Lo
 cation: Old City Hall 315 E. Kennedy Blvd. Tampa FL 33602 Agenda: https:ta
 mpa.govagendas (https:tampa.govagendas) The purpose of this Special Call B
 udget Workshop\, the first of three\, is tentatively scheduled to review a
 nd discuss the Recommended Fiscal Year 2027 Budget for the City of Tampa r
 elative to Enterprise Funds: Solid Waste\, Water\, Wastewater and Parking.
  Copies of the entire proposed budget will be available for review on or b
 efore July 30th on the Citys website at https:www.tampa.govbudget or at th
 e City Clerks Office\, 3rd Floor\, Old City Hall\, 315 East Kennedy Boulev
 ard\, Tampa\, Florida\, Monday through Friday\, 8:00 AM to 5:00 PM (exclud
 ing City holidays). The public and citizens of the City of Tampa will be a
 ble to watch\, listen or view this meeting: Cable TV: Spectrum Channel 640
  Frontier Channel 15 Internet: https:www.tampa.govlivestream (https:www.ta
 mpa.govlivestream) PUBLIC COMMENT WILL BE LIMITED TO THE SUBJECT OF THE SP
 ECIAL CALL WORKSHOP. MEMBERS OF THE PUBLIC MAY ADDRESS CITY COUNCIL ONCE F
 OR 3 MINUTES AFTER ALL PRESENTATIONS HAVE BEEN MADE. In accordance with th
 e Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) and Section 286.26\, Florida Statu
 tes\, persons with disabilities needing a reasonable accommodation to part
 icipate in this public hearing or meeting should contact the City of Tampa
 s ADA Coordinator at least 48 hours prior to the proceeding. The ADA Coord
 inator may be contacted via phone at 813-274- 3964\, email at TampaADAtamp
 agov.net\, or by submitting an ADA - Accommodations Request form available
  online at https:tampa.govADARequest. (https:tampa.govADARequest.) For add
 itional information\, please contact City Council Attorney Martin Shelby a
 t Martin.Shelbytampa.gov or 813-274-7719. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa
 .gov/node/193051
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/193051
END:VEVENT
